        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ਆਰਾਮ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਆਰਾਮ — ārām — \"rest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਦੁਪਹਿਰ ਨੂੰ ਦਾਦਾ ਜੀ ਆਰਾਮ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ। dupahir nū̃ dādā jī ārām karde han. My grandfather rests in the afternoon."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਆਰਾਮ (ārām) is borrowed: it is usually traced to Persian ārām, \"rest, quiet\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
